        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-2fc21bab61@example.invalid",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Weighted</span><br>\n <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">in your favor</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Based on surgeon input, these headlights were designed for comfort and long-term wear in the OR. By choosing premium padding and head strap features, we created a more balanced-feeling headlight for a just-right, shake-free experience during your most important work.</span></span></span></p>\n",
